        "native_id": "94hjg1mw4yt1",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Mac jobs are continuing to experience failures. Our infrastructure provider is continuing to report that they are experiencing a DDoS attack causing high network latency and packet loss for our Mac fleet. We are working to bring up additional capacity to restore service.",
